OL,3,ARussian strikes on Ukraine kill two,
OL,4,Aofficials say, a day after deadly
OL,5,Aattack on mall
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least two people have been killed in
OL,8,FUkraine by Russian strikes while nine
OL,9,Fpeople remain missing a day after a
OL,10,Fdouble-tap attack on a shopping centre
OL,11,Fthat killed 16.
OL,13,FLocal authorities said one person was
OL,14,Fkilled in a warehouse fire in Kyiv
OL,15,Fafter an alert for a ballistic missile
OL,16,Fwhile another was killed in a drone
OL,17,Fstrike on Zaporizhzhia in the early
OL,18,Fhours of Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
